computing/src/scheme/prologue

This directory contains the Turing machine simulator, turing-machine.rkt,
written in Racket.

The directory machines/ contains various Turing machines used in the text
and the exercises.

Note also the presence of a unit tester for those machines, at
computing/bin/turing_machine/tm_test.py.  And, there are scripts
to convert the input to output.  Notably, in
computing/prologue/asy/tm_exercises is tm_exercises.sh that gives
the .pdf outputs used in the text and exercises.